clinical candidate for the treatment of patients with glycogen storage disease type Ia; DTX301, an AAV8 gene therapy for the treatment of patients with ornithine transcarbamylase; and GTX-102, an antisense oligonucleotide for the treatment of Angelman syndrome. It also develops UX701, an adeno-associated AAV9 gene therapy which is in Phase 2 clinical trial for the treatment of Wilson liver disease. The company has collaboration and license agreement with Kyowa Kirin Co., Ltd.; Saint Louis University; Baylor Research Institute; REGENXBIO Inc.; GeneTx; Mereo; University of Pennsylvania; Regeneron; and Abeona. Ultragenyx Pharmaceutical Inc. was incorporated in 2010 and is headquartered in Novato, California.","employees":1371,"website":"https://www.ultragenyx.com","country":"United States","city":"Novato","officers":[{"name":"Dr. Emil D. Kakkis M.D., Ph.D.","title":"Founder, President, CEO & Director"},{"name":"Mr. Howard  Horn","title":"Executive VP of Corporate Strategy & CFO"},{"name":"Ms. Karah Herdman Parschauer J.D.","title":"Chief Legal Officer & Executive VP of Corporate Affairs"}]},"sector_medians":{"fpe":19.17,"tpe":29.98,"ps":4.488,"pfcf":28.95,"peg":1.365,"pb":4.556,"ev_ebitda":16.93,"rev_growth":0.1,"eps_growth":0.1735,"eps_growth_fwd":0.09465,"eps_growth_next":0.1197,"div_yield":0,"roe":0.01872,"roa":0.02349,"de":41.94,"gross_margin":0.4961,"op_margin":0.03472,"profit_margin":0,"current_ratio":3.1},"valuation":[{"k":"fpe","label":"Forward P/E","v":74.38,"sector":19.17,"verdict":"Overvalued"},{"k":"tpe","label":"TTM P/E","v":-1,"sector":29.98,"verdict":"Loss-making"},{"k":"ps","label":"Price / Sales","v":2.307,"sector":4.488,"verdict":"Undervalued"},{"k":"pfcf","label":"Price / FCF","v":-1,"sector":28.95,"verdict":"Negative FCF"},{"k":"peg","label":"PEG","v":null,"sector":1.365,"verdict":"—"},{"k":"pb","label":"Price / Book","v":null,"sector":4.556,"verdict":"—"},{"k":"de","label":"Debt / Equity (%)","v":null,"sector":41.94,"verdict":"—"},{"k":"rev_growth"